# Server Version

- `server/` must build from Docker context `.` and must not depend on `../desktop`.
- Server extensions belong in `server/app/`; core FastAPI currently lives in `server/main.py`.
- **Load skills**: `maxserver-fastapi-backend`, `maxserver-server-deploy`, `maxserver-postgresql`, `maxserver-auth-security` (see `ai-skills-system.mdc`).
- Run `docker compose config` after Docker, compose, Caddy, or env changes.
- Do not expose the app port publicly without Caddy and auth controls.
- Treat auth, tenant, JWT, admin, secrets, and data isolation changes as security-sensitive.
